{"seq":39,"at":"2026-10-23","kind":"corrected","target":{"type":"article","id":"a2263"},"reason":"The bodies called Rocket Beans TV \"Germany's first 24-hour internet TV channel\". No source we could read (Wikipedia, DWDL, heise, BR PULS, Welt, Gamestar) says it was the first; they describe it as a 24-hour internet/streaming channel launched on Twitch on 15 January 2015 (the founders themselves called it the \"biggest German live-streaming channel\"). The unverifiable \"first\" was dropped in all three languages.","by":"provenance-research","sources":[{"url":"https://www.dwdl.de/nachrichten/48966/rocket_beans_wollen_livestreamingsender_starten/"},{"url":"https://www.br.de/puls/themen/netz/rocket-beans-tv-interview-etienne-garde-100.html"},{"url":"https://de.wikipedia.org/wiki/Rocket_Beans_TV"}],"changes":[{"field":"bodyEn","diff":[["=",266],["-","Germany's"],["+","a"],["=",1],["-","first "],["=",243]]},{"field":"bodyDe","diff":[["=",240],["-","Deutschlands"],["+","ein"],["=",1],["-","erster "],["=",213]]},{"field":"bodyRu","diff":[["=",244],["-","первый в Германии "],["=",227]]}],"hash":"36d28a3c7e14","actor":{"kind":"agent","name":"provenance-research"},"run":"provenance-research-2026-10-23","chain":"0c6fd7e9cdef78035d8479b835ed425165eb2c72897906b2d25be03950722371"},
{"seq":40,"at":"2026-10-23","kind":"corrected","target":{"type":"fact","id":"f11605"},"reason":"Timeline labels repeated the unverified claim that Rocket Beans TV was Germany's first 24-hour internet channel; now they say it was a 24-hour internet channel starting on Twitch.","by":"provenance-research","sources":[{"url":"https://www.dwdl.de/nachrichten/48966/rocket_beans_wollen_livestreamingsender_starten/"}],"changes":[{"field":"timeline","old":{"labelEn":"Rocket Beans TV, Germany's first 24-hour internet channel, starts broadcasting","labelDe":"Rocket Beans TV, Deutschlands erster 24-Stunden-Internetsender, nimmt den Sendebetrieb auf","labelRu":"Rocket Beans TV, первый в Германии круглосуточный интернет-канал, начинает вещание"},"new":{"labelEn":"Rocket Beans TV, a 24-hour internet channel, starts broadcasting on Twitch","labelDe":"Rocket Beans TV, ein 24-Stunden-Internetsender, nimmt auf Twitch den Sendebetrieb auf","labelRu":"Rocket Beans TV, круглосуточный интернет-канал, начинает вещание на Twitch"}}],"hash":"ec64a15c63f3","actor":{"kind":"agent","name":"provenance-research"},"run":"provenance-research-2026-10-23","chain":"99b54b14e622a03f6931c7ff580002be2435afce22430df37abf7c2f8cee5d12"},
{"seq":41,"at":"2026-10-23","kind":"reworded","target":{"type":"wording","id":"w11680"},"reason":"The Trivial Pursuit card asks for \"the first 24-hour internet channel in Germany\"; that premise could not be confirmed by any source, so the question now identifies the channel by what is verifiable (24-hour internet channel, live on Twitch in January 2015, founded by ex-GIGA Games/Game One presenters). The card's words stay in cardText.","by":"provenance-research","sources":[{"url":"https://www.dwdl.de/nachrichten/48966/rocket_beans_wollen_livestreamingsender_starten/"},{"url":"https://de.wikipedia.org/wiki/Rocket_Beans_TV"}],"changes":[{"field":"en","old":"What is the name of Germany's first 24-hour internet TV channel, founded in 2015 by former GIGA Games and Game One presenters among others?","new":"What is the name of the 24-hour internet TV channel that went live on Twitch in January 2015, founded by former GIGA Games and Game One presenters among others?"},{"field":"de","old":"Wie heißt der erste 24-Stunden-Internetsender Deutschlands, der im Jahr 2015 unter anderem von Ex-GIGA-Games und Game One-Moderatoren gegründet wurde?","new":"Wie heißt der 24-Stunden-Internetsender, der im Januar 2015 auf Twitch startete und unter anderem von Ex-GIGA-Games- und Game-One-Moderatoren gegründet wurde?"},{"field":"ru","old":"Как называется первый в Германии круглосуточный интернет-телеканал, основанный в 2015 году, среди прочих, бывшими ведущими GIGA Games и Game One?","new":"Как называется круглосуточный интернет-телеканал, запущенный на Twitch в январе 2015 года, среди основателей которого были бывшие ведущие GIGA Games и Game One?"},{"field":"cardText","new":"Wie heißt der erste 24-Stunden-Internetsender Deutschlands, der im Jahr 2015 unter anderem von Ex-GIGA-Games und Game One-Moderatoren gegründet wurde?"}],"hash":"c0e892dc18fd","actor":{"kind":"agent","name":"provenance-research"},"run":"provenance-research-2026-10-23","chain":"94695c667825c6e4b68175a3b955e0ae64d8fb12